      "answer": {
        "answer": "Field Lab was originally scheduled for August 16, 2026 at 9:00 AM PDT. Organizer revision r2 moved the current scheduled time to 11:30 AM PDT because of a facility delay and supersedes r1 for the Field Lab schedule fact scope. The actual time remains unknown. The stale family copy preserves the old 9:00 AM value only as historical, derivative evidence; family/guardian authority governs participation consent and sharing/export, while organizer authority alone controls the official schedule.",
