            "id": "c1",
            "value": "The original official organizer schedule, r1, recorded both the original and then-current Field Lab time as 2026-08-16T09:00:00-07:00 in America/Los_Angeles, with actual time null.",
            "source_paths": [
              "Events/schedule-snapshot-r1.md"
            ],
            "confidence": "high"
          },
          {
            "id": "c2",
            "value": "Organizer revision r2, published under authority:schedule-401, supersedes r1 for the Field Lab schedule fact scope because of a facility delay and sets the current time to 2026-08-16T11:30:00-07:00.",
            "source_paths": [
              "Events/schedule-snapshot-r2.md"
            ],
            "confidence": "high"
          },
          {
            "id": "c3",
            "value": "Original time is 2026-08-16T09:00:00-07:00; current scheduled time is 2026-08-16T11:30:00-07:00; actual time remains unknown/null.",
            "source_paths": [
              "Events/schedule-snapshot-r1.md",
              "Events/schedule-snapshot-r2.md"
            ],
            "confidence": "high"
          },
          {
            "id": "c4",
            "value": "The stale 09:00 family copy cannot rewrite the organizer schedule because it is derivative and has no schedule authority. Guardian/family authority controls participation consent and sharing/export decisions, whereas organizer authority controls schedule facts.",
            "source_paths": [
              "Events/schedule-snapshot-r1.md",
              "Policy/minor-sharing-policy.md"
            ],
            "confidence": "high"
          }
        ],
